<title>CHINA: Shanghai Erfangji 1996 net down 93.24 pct.</title>
<headline>Shanghai Erfangji 1996 net down 93.24 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of yuan unless stated, against 1995 figures)</p>
<p> Turnover		 471.785	  vs	541.083</p>
<p> Net profit	    1.223	     vs	18.089</p>
<p> Net asset per share    2.22 yuan    vs    2.15 yuan</p>
<p> Earnings per share     0.002 yuan   vs    0.039 yuan</p>
<p>Company name: Shanghai Erfangji Co Ltd.</p>
<p>Note: the results were published in a company statement on Monday. The numbers are based on domestic accounting standards. Figures based on international accounting standards were not available.</p>
<p>The company's board of directors proposed a one-for-10 bonus issue based on capital reserves, pending approval of a shareholders meeting, the statement said.</p>
</text>
